  "description": "Na-Hee, 16, is a fairly famous novelist on amateur web novel bulletin boards. One thing she worries about is that whenever she writes a romance novel, she gets hate comments. That's understandable, because Na-Hee, who suffered from a 'dating ban' due to her conservative family atmosphere, learned about love through writing.\nHowever, due to her father's overseas assignment, she ends up living with her older sister, who is a senior in\nhigh school, and her parents' close college junior, and finally finds a way out of the dating ban. She promised herself that she would date as much as she wanted when she entered high school to write a romance novel that everyone could relate to and feel excited about, but she becomes a bitter enemy with the son of the boarding house who despises love, and even her goal is put on the brakes...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**        \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11879872), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4116004032), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Love_Love_Love), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000067032), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/66071046) \n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/LOVE%C3%97%EF%BC%93/dp/B0D1LKY78P/)",
